<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="651449688"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:05.373"><div begin="20.677" end="45.344" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="20.677" end="25.452" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.677" end="21.273">和</span><span begin="21.273" end="22.831">你也许不</span><span begin="22.831" end="23.059">会</span><span begin="23.059" end="23.546">再</span><span begin="23.546" end="24.414">相</span><span begin="24.414" end="25.452">拥</span></p><p begin="26.929" end="32.858" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.929" end="27.892">大概</span><span begin="27.892" end="28.282">你</span><span begin="28.282" end="28.528">的</span><span begin="28.528" end="28.977">体</span><span begin="28.977" end="29.643">重</span><span begin="30.210" end="31.472">会抱我</span><span begin="31.472" end="31.762">造</span><span begin="31.762" end="32.858">梦</span></p><p begin="32.978" end="39.163" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.978" end="33.486">从前</span><span begin="33.486" end="33.877">为</span><span begin="33.877" end="34.135">了</span><span begin="34.135" end="34.398">不</span><span begin="34.398" end="35.013">想</span><span begin="35.013" end="35.991">失约</span> <span begin="36.434" end="37.284">连病都</span><span begin="37.284" end="38.102">不敢</span><span begin="38.102" end="39.163">痛</span></p><p begin="39.334" end="45.344" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.334" end="39.831">到</span><span begin="39.831" end="40.508">哪一</span><span begin="40.508" end="41.515">天</span><span begin="41.725" end="42.907">才回想</span><span begin="42.907" end="44.143">起</span><span begin="44.143" end="44.359">我</span><span begin="44.359" end="45.344">蠢</span></p></div><div begin="46.011" end="1:11.547" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="46.011" end="50.683" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.011" end="48.063">和你也许不</span><span begin="48.063" end="48.309">会</span><span begin="48.309" end="48.830">再</span><span begin="48.830" end="49.514">通</span><span begin="49.514" end="50.683">宵</span></p><p begin="52.291" end="58.013" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.291" end="53.560">坐到咖</span><span begin="53.560" end="54.198">啡酸</span><span begin="54.198" end="54.969">了</span> <span begin="55.493" end="56.319">喝也</span><span begin="56.319" end="56.751">喝</span><span begin="56.751" end="57.017">不</span><span begin="57.017" end="58.013">掉</span></p><p begin="58.252" end="1:04.263" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.252" end="58.653">从</span><span begin="58.653" end="59.119">前</span><span begin="59.119" end="59.407">为</span><span begin="59.407" end="59.767">你</span><span begin="59.767" end="1:00.323">舍</span><span begin="1:00.323" end="1:00.892">得无</span><span begin="1:00.892" end="1:01.439">聊</span> <span begin="1:01.439" end="1:01.884">宁</span><span begin="1:01.884" end="1:02.279">愿</span><span begin="1:02.279" end="1:02.844">休息</span><span begin="1:02.844" end="1:03.462">不</span><span begin="1:03.462" end="1:04.263">要</span></p><p begin="1:04.614" end="1:11.547" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.614" end="1:05.136">谈论</span><span begin="1:05.136" end="1:06.614">连场大雨</span> <span begin="1:06.614" end="1:07.316">你窗</span><span begin="1:07.316" end="1:07.670">台</span><span begin="1:07.670" end="1:08.099">漏</span><span begin="1:08.099" end="1:09.377">水</span><span begin="1:09.377" end="1:09.659">不</span><span begin="1:09.659" end="1:10.238">得</span><span begin="1:10.238" end="1:11.547">了</span></p></div><div begin="1:12.797" end="1:48.262" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:12.797" end="1:20.132" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.797" end="1:13.418">从</span><span begin="1:13.418" end="1:14.541">来未爱</span><span begin="1:14.541" end="1:15.669">你</span><span begin="1:15.669" end="1:16.112">绵</span><span begin="1:16.112" end="1:17.166">绵</span> <span begin="1:17.166" end="1:18.025">可惜</span><span begin="1:18.025" end="1:18.288">我</span><span begin="1:18.288" end="1:18.825">爱</span><span